ized return as we've guided to in 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2020 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Lapides","x":"And finally are there any major cost savings areas where you think you could offset some of that bill inflation?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2020 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2020-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Foster","x":"We have increased the guidance for 2019 10-K fire related costs by $20 million to approximately $170 million for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"We've got multiyear general rate cases, pass-through costs for commodity procurement, decoupling, separate cost of capital proceedings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q2","e":"pcg","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"Our investments will provide lasting value to our customers, while our new cost reduction efforts will keep our customer bills affordable.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q2","e":"pcg","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Foster","x":"Recognizing the diversity of our hometowns we serve, we will continue to execute an opportunity for cost savings that benefit our customers such as our recent San Francisco headquarters sale and capital plan enhancements to invest in the system at reduced costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2021-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Foster","x":"And then second, as you can imagine, just kind of going forward very traditionally, these costs are considered costs that are part of cost of service and are passed through the customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2021-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"…already some of our wells on the visibility that we have with our daily operating review cadence, or experienced executives on a routine annual basis, I suggest those cost savings will materialize and they are materializing now and they won't materialize for years and years and years to come.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2021-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"Yeah, I think it's really continuing to streamline our vegetation management and our hardening plan.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q4","e":"pcg","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Patricia Poppe","x":"Our progress on undergrounding, gas distribution main replacements, our non-fuel O&M cost reduction, and several financial metrics.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2021 Q4","e":"pcg","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Patricia Poppe","x":"We've got the right operating system in place to deliver industry leading financial growth fueled by the important safety and resiliency driven infrastructure investments funded by our cost savings, our growing load, and good management practices to keep customer bills affordable.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2022 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher Foster","x":"You'll hear more about these cost reduction programs at our Investor Day this June.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2022 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r