er solutions for customers such as our self-insurance settlement.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2023-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Patricia Poppe","x":"Also, in support of customer affordability, we worked with the state to offset commodity price increases on winter bills with an acceleration of the annual California Climate Credit.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2023-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Foster","x":"In 2022, we exceeded our non-fuel O&M cost reduction target, taking 3% out of the business despite inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2023-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Foster","x":"As I mentioned on the year-end call, we see more opportunities for customers ahead, and the team is just getting started in terms of finding cost savings and eliminating waste.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q2","e":"pcg","d":"2023-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carolyn Burke","x":"So far this year we've realized $0.04 of favorability from our cost-saving efforts and we've redeployed $0.02 right back into the business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q2","e":"pcg","d":"2023-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carolyn Burke","x":"Patti already provided an update on our O&M cost reduction progress.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"They reduce trench depth and width while staying in compliance with county standards and they found additional cost savings during the backfill process.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"With the Fire Victim trust completing their sales, restoring our credit ratings to investment grade to unlock significant financing cost savings for customers and reinstating our common dividend.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q3","e":"pcg","d":"2023-10-26","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Patti Poppe","x":"While we await the final decision, our memo account allows us to reaffirm our 2023 guidance range of $1.19 to $1.23.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q4","e":"pcg","d":"2024-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patricia Poppe","x":"Key elements of the California regulatory model include four years of revenue certainty under the GRC, returns which are set separately from the GRC including a formulaic adjustment mechanism, and timely recovery for pass-through of important cost categories including fuel and pension.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q4","e":"pcg","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carolyn Burke","x":"This is not a cost-cutting program at PG&E. Rather, this is about good business decisions, which are sustainable for the long-term, and it's about using the performance playbook, including the Lean operating system, to improve how we do our work every day.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2023 Q4","e":"pcg","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patricia Poppe","x":"But as we look forward, we see the capital demand matched by our cost savings, load growth and efficient financing, which allows for affordable bills for customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"PCG 2024 Q1","e":"pcg","d":"2024-04-25",